# Staged camera originals, not for deploy yet.
# Cloudflare Pages builds from the git clone, so anything ignored here never
# reaches production even though Astro copies public/ into dist/ locally.
# Nothing in src/ references a .HEIC: pages use the webp derivatives under
# public/images/directory/. To deploy one deliberately: git add -f <path>
*.HEIC
*.heic
*.MOV
*.mov
